      "version": 422,
      "versionNonce": 1356086376,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786896401744,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "JobScheduler (Repeat this with some frequency Eg.1 min)\n- Fetch Job instance with status!=SUCCESS\n- Push it into a queue\n\nJob Dispatcher (SQS)\n- Read from queue \n- Each worker handles to a job instance\n- Call resource manager , keep retrying",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "JobScheduler (Repeat this with some frequency Eg.1 min)\n- Fetch Job instance with status!=SUCCESS\n- Push it into a queue\n\nJob Dispatcher (SQS)\n- Read from queue \n- Each worker handles to a job instance\n- Call resource manager , keep retrying",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
